<title>USA: Cytotherapeutics says John McBride CFO.</title>
<headline>Cytotherapeutics says John McBride CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PROVIDENCE, R.I. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>CytoTherapeutics Inc said Tuesday John McBride was elected chief financial officer, treasurer, and senior vice president of business operations.</p>
<p>The company said the position is effective June 2.</p>
<p>The company said McBride was previously vice president at Phytera Inc.</p>
<p>The company said McBride replaces Daniel Gesfken, who resigned in February to work for Transkaryotic Therapies Inc.</p>
